# testscene_1: Orrery: sphere, clipped sphere, annulus, raised disk, triangles, icosahedron, tiny spheres
# Category: camera. A ringed planet (sphere + tilted annulus), an open lantern (sphere clipped by zmin, zmax and phimax), a disk raised by 'height', a 20-triangle gem, a comet (sphere + thin triangle), a non-planar kite and stars only a few pixels wide. Checks every primitive's intersection and the perspective camera at sub-pixel level.
# Reference: testsuite_ref_1.pfm, rendered by pbrt-v4 from testscene_1_pbrt.pbrt (same scene; only Integrator, Sampler and Film differ).
# pbrt-v4 version of testscene_1.pbrt, used to render the reference image.
